  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(x + 4)3 + (2x + 1)3 + (2x + 5)3 = (6x + 3) (x + 4) (2x + 5)\n\n**Concept:**\n\nIf a³ + b³ + c³ = 3abc, then a + b + c = 0\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(x + 4)3 + (2x + 1)3 + (2x + 5)3 = (6x + 3) (x + 4) (2x + 5)\n\n⇒ (x + 4)3 + (2x + 1)3 + (2x + 5)3 = 3(2x + 1) (x + 4) (2x + 5)\n\na = (x + 4), b = (2x + 1) and c = (2x + 5)\n\nThen, (x + 4 + 2x + 1 + 2x + 5) = 0\n\n⇒ 5x + 10 = 0\n\n⇒ 5x = -10\n\n⇒ x = -2\n\n**∴ The value of x is -2.**",
